+"""idp-max-open-prs-gate — refuses a push when the REPO already has >= MAX open non-bot PRs.
 
-Founder 2026-09-17 verbatim: "we should not even get here — limit no of open PRs 5 maximum" and
-"not author, this is repo not author based". REPO-WIDE cap: the estate as a whole holds no more
-than IDP_MAX_OPEN_PRS (default 5) open non-bot PRs at any time.
+Founder 2026-09-17: 10 open PRs was 'red signal', consolidated into one branch, and this gate
